{"slug": "spacex", "name": "SpaceX", "category": "Media & Consumer Tech", "summary": "Space technology. Stark black and white, full-bleed imagery, futuristic", "description": "An inspired interpretation of Spasex's design language — a mission-oriented aerospace brand built on pure black canvas, full-bleed photographic and video heroes of rockets and Mars landscapes, and uppercase D-DIN display type set in tight vertical leading. UI chrome is intentionally minimal a single ghost outlined pill button per band, all-caps eyebrow microtext, and a fixed top nav over photography. The system is unapologetically austere — black, white, and the imagery itself.", "colors": [{"name": "Canvas Night", "hex": "#000000", "group": "Surface", "token": "canvas-night", "role": "Default marketing canvas. Pure black, no tint."}, {"name": "Canvas Night Soft", "hex": "#0a0a0a", "group": "Surface", "token": "canvas-night-soft", "role": "Barely-lifted near-black for content sections that need a subtle separation from the pure-black hero."}, {"name": "Canvas Light", "hex": "#ffffff", "group": "Surface", "token": "canvas-light", "role": "The shop site's product surface."}, {"name": "Canvas Cool", "hex": "#f0f0fa", "group": "Surface", "token": "canvas-cool", "role": "A pale cool-blue-white used as the secondary surface on the shop site and as the hover-canvas of certain ghost buttons."}, {"name": "Hairline on Dark", "hex": "#3a3a3f", "group": "Surface", "token": "hairline-on-dark", "role": "1px borders on dark surface chrome."}, {"name": "Hairline on Light", "hex": "#e0e0e8", "group": "Surface", "token": "hairline-on-light", "role": "Borders on shop-site cards."}, {"name": "On Primary", "hex": "#ffffff", "group": "Text", "token": "on-primary", "role": "Default text on dark canvas; the dominant text color across the marketing site."}, {"name": "On Primary Mute", "hex": "#f0f0fa", "group": "Text", "token": "on-primary-mute", "role": "Slightly cooled-white used for secondary text on dark surfaces 